  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Evaluat Trust Fund EBRD</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Utv&#xe4;rd konsultfond EBRD</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sverige har genom BITS/Sida sedan 1991 haft en konsultfond i EBRD. Avtal om den senaste p&#xe5;fyllnaden med 15 milj kr genomf&#xf6;rdes 1997. Inf&#xf6;r en eventuell p&#xe5;fyllnad avser Sida utv&#xe4;rdera EBRDs utnyttjande av fondmedel. F&#xf6;r uppdraget anlitas Claes de Neergard.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Trust Fund was established in 1991 with the purpose to finance Swedish consultants to be retained by EBRD. The last replenishment agreement 1997 was for 15 million SEK. Sida has decided to carry out an evaluation of the utilization of the Trust Fund.Claes de Neergard will be engaged for the assignment.</narrative>
  </description>
